{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOK. COMMAND. COMPETE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GladiEATers is a narrative creature battler that blends top-down JRPG, cooking minigames and 6v6 turn-based creature battles.</strong> Follow the stories of seven Combat Chefs as they compete to become champion of the CALosseum, and watch their relationships (and your skills) simmer as you take on roguelike tournament mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/21ce59f97fa1216a5d2bb43fc2aa5d2c.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/21ce59f97fa1216a5d2bb43fc2aa5d2c.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/21ce59f97fa1216a5d2bb43fc2aa5d2c.mp4?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK YOUR CREATURES?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, boil, bake and fry your ingredients into fighting shape in a snappy series of bite-sized minigames. Each round is a chance to add to your team or evolve your existing fighters into new, more powerful evolutions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/cc338726f9855d309cb20124a023787a.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/cc338726f9855d309cb20124a023787a.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/cc338726f9855d309cb20124a023787a.mp4?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR COMBAT CHEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven stories of cooking, conflict, and compassion all lead to the CALosseum: A pun-flinging egg farmer, a monolingual Finnish baker (and his best friend) and at least one secret agent will prove themselves, settle old scores, and maybe even make a few friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/c88c955230c9c7dee424469bcb3735d2.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/c88c955230c9c7dee424469bcb3735d2.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/c88c955230c9c7dee424469bcb3735d2.mp4?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each character's culinary specialties in their playable backstory, then embark on a JRPG journey set off by the events of the tournament. Discover the drama behind every dish as GladiEATers explores what it means to cook and eat in a story featuring gorgeous pixel animation, and comic sections from Marvel and DC artist Rosi K\u00e4mpe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT YOUR FRIENDS (with food)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve up your skills against a friend in online multiplayer. Or take your Combat Chef powers into a ranked leaderboard to become the best Combat Chef in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/82d5602af0dc13beb32adc2faf0c3b49.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=613 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/82d5602af0dc13beb32adc2faf0c3b49.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE MENU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story continues and the intensity rises in CALosseum Mode! Take on a series of increasingly tough battles and test your skills with spicy run modifiers, character meta-progression, and unlockable special abilities and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.mp4?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GladiEATers Features...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 converging Chef Stories that intertwine into a top-down JRPG adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 v 1 Online Multiplayer Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ GladiEATers all lovingly rendered in gorgeous pixel artwork, plus hidden and unlockable variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ unique hand-animated abilities in deep turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-Buy mode where you draft a team of culinary creatures rather than cook them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic artwork by Marvel and DC artist Rosi K\u00e4mpe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique synergies and tactics to explore, with up to 12 GladiEATers in play at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-you-can-eat endless roguelike mode with sweet and savoury run modifiers and meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 cosmetic mutations per GladiEATer to collect!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/f252be1e961356cc2618e4ec545bf048.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/f252be1e961356cc2618e4ec545bf048.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141280?t=1757092261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757092261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/c0791863fbde28313bdfc521cc686c418a6efc0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757092261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/c0791863fbde28313bdfc521cc686c418a6efc0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757092261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOK. COMMAND. COMPETE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GladiEATers is a narrative creature battler that blends top-down JRPG, cooking minigames and 6v6 turn-based creature battles.</strong> Follow the stories of seven Combat Chefs as they compete to become champion of the CA