reasingly tough battles and test your skills with spicy run modifiers, character meta-progression, and unlockable special abilities and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.poster.avif?t=1757092261\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.webm?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141280/extras/6a05419ab0ab117ddaf48942bd12c3c2.mp4?t=1757092261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GladiEATers Features...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 converging Chef Stories that intertwine into a top-down JRPG adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 v 1 Online Multiplayer Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ GladiEATers all lovingly rendered in gorgeous pixel artwork, plus hidden and unlockable variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ unique hand-animated abilities in deep turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-Buy mode where you draft a team of culinary creatures rather than cook them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic artwork by Marvel and DC artist Rosi K\u00e4mpe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique synergies and tactics to explore, with up to 12 GladiEATers in play at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-you-can-eat endless roguelike mode with sweet and savoury run modifiers and meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 cosmetic mutations per GladiEATer to collect!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poste